# Health Check API
# Endpoint publik untuk memverifikasi status service dan koneksi database

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health Check - Get Service Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Health Check - Verify Response Structure
# Expected fields: status, service, version, nodeEnv, uptime, db
# Status code: 200
# Response body should contain:
# {
#   "status": "ok",
#   "service": "...",
#   "version": "...",
#   "nodeEnv": "...",
#   "uptime": ...,
#   "db": {
#     "connected": true/false,
#     "reconnecting": true/false
#   }
# }